===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The process of [[checking out]] of a [[hotel]], or the latest [[time]] to [[vacate]] a [[room]] in one.
# The process of checking out [[item]]s at a [[supermarket]] or [[library]].
# The place in a [[supermarket]] where this is done.
# {{lb|en|internet|by extension}} The process of confirming and [[pay]]ing for an [[online]] [[purchase]].
# A [[test]] to see if some [[device]] is [[functioning]] [[properly]].
# An [[inspection]] or [[investigation]].
# {{lb|en|darts}} The number of points that a player scores on their final, winning visit to the [[oche]].

